    "sections": {
        "description": "Optical Glasses Theme is designed with a clean layout focused on product presentation, organized navigation, and responsive structure. The theme includes sections for featured products, category displays, promotional banners, customer reviews, and contact information. It supports customizable typography, color settings, logo uploads, and homepage arrangements through built-in customization options. The layout is optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile screens to maintain consistent browsing across devices. Product pages can display images, pricing, descriptions, and related items in a structured format. The theme also includes support for social media links, newsletter sections, and search functionality for easier navigation. Code structure follows standard development practices to support compatibility with modern plugins and regular updates. The design emphasizes readability and clear spacing while keeping the interface simple and functional. The theme can also support multilingual plugins and translation-ready features depending on the installed setup."
    },
